                <mxCell id="launch-prep" value="&lt;b&gt;Phase 0: Preparation&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;(initial 전용)&lt;hr size=&quot;1&quot;&gt;• 앱 정보 추출 (app.json)&lt;br&gt;• Store 계정 확인&lt;br&gt;&amp;nbsp; - Apple Developer + App ID&lt;br&gt;&amp;nbsp; - Google Play Console&lt;br&gt;• eas.json 설정 완성&lt;br&gt;• Cleartext 보안 플래그 변환&lt;br&gt;&amp;nbsp; (app.json → app.config.ts)&lt;br&gt;• Legal Document URL 확인" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#f5e0f0;strokeColor=#993366;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=8;spacingTop=4;fontSize=11;" parent="1" vertex="1">
